note Its whole vocabulary: edges, centre, containment for hit tests (right and bottom exclusive), intersection for clips (an empty result rather than a negative size), shrink for insetting a border, and the emptiness test that skips a draw. Nothing here allocates or branches on anything but arithmetic.

